# Boot to the Corn tutorial, unattended.  RECOMP_PAD_SCRIPT=@this-file
#
# The title wants START, START, A -- not a mash. The first START leaves the
# attract animation, the second takes the menu, and A selects New Game. The
# group repeats every 8 s because how long the logos take varies by ten seconds
# or more between runs, so the schedule must not depend on hitting one window.
#
# It stops at t=73. Past the title, START is the PAUSE button and a synthetic
# one every few seconds leaves the title sitting in covered pause, which reads
# exactly like a hang -- a whole session went on diagnosing that. Stopping also
# hands the pad back to a person: RECOMP_PAD_SCRIPT merges with a live
# controller rather than replacing it.
#
# Measured 13 Sep: reaches WaitEndStoryOrVsMission at t=46.9 and holds the Corn
# tutorial (live=61) with nobody at the machine.

12.0:START  13.5:START  15.0:A
20.0:START  21.5:START  23.0:A
28.0:START  29.5:START  31.0:A
36.0:START  37.5:START  39.0:A
44.0:START  45.5:START  47.0:A
52.0:START  53.5:START  55.0:A
60.0:START  61.5:START  63.0:A
68.0:START  69.5:START  71.0:A
